  first | exact @GlobalTheory.DescAb.abLocus_eq_range_and_relDim | exact GlobalTheory.DescAb.abLocus_eq_range_and_relDim | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.DescAb.abLocus_eq_range_and_relDim <;> assumption)
